{"server":"cn","storyId":"act33side_level_act33side_st02","groupId":"act33side","stageId":"act33side_st02","title":"在疲惫中苏醒","storyCode":"BB-ST-2","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act33side/level_act33side_st02.txt","sourceHash":"c7f6e5cd80290889c8cc9267f5a7cda25481d87b374cf33a5a13571189708a66","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"1090年，在做了周密的准备之后，凯尔希和特蕾西娅终于唤醒了“博士”。博士第一次与泰拉文明有了直接的接触。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"我为你准备了一份礼物，{@nickname}。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"你听到了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"还记得吗？这是AMa-10诞生时产生的偏振，你说你在它的波形中找到了一段旋律。当然，我也加入了一些“个人创作”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"我调整了远行星轨道阵列的方向来捕获不同的回响，和声提取自恒星熄灭时的中微子余韵，配器是航船穿过星门时留下的重力褶皱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......我就知道你会喜欢，{@nickname}。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宇宙的歌唱......哪怕在此时此刻依旧无比动人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但这样做便打破了由我们亲手制定的准则，普瑞赛斯。这些设施本应永远运行在预设的轨迹里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"群星正在褪色。这个世界已经没有准则了，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"这里很快也会安静下来，就像我们从未来过一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"陪我走走吧，在归于寂静前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望......我们还会一起亲眼看到这个世界的未来，{@nickname}。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“会的......我会在那个世界等你。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodescom"},{"type":"narration","text":"四年前\n1090年夏\n卡兹戴尔地区，巴别塔罗德岛本舰"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_050","isRemote":false,"text":"呼！电力通道改造总算完成了，这下总能扛得住冲击了吧？应该吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_050","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希竟敢抓我连续工作四十八个小时......等这事儿结束了，我一定在殿下面前狠狠告她的状！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_1311_1","isRemote":true,"text":"确认进入本舰通讯范围，讯号清晰。你藏起来的迷你基站很好用，可露希尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_050","isRemote":false,"text":"那还用说！这可是连殿下都没见过的好东西！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_1311_1","isRemote":true,"text":"殿下她们的“研究”结束了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_050","isRemote":false,"text":"前几次产生的能量涌动差点让罗德岛熄火，我还在加固舰船应对下一次冲击。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_050","isRemote":false,"text":"想要掩盖本舰闹出的动静可费了我不少的心思，万一被军事委员会的探子抓住漏洞——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":true,"text":"放心。我已经肃清了周围所有目标，专心准备就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":true,"text":"Scout，汇报。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_1311_1","isRemote":true,"text":"潜入任务已经完成，正在将情报传回巴别塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":true,"text":"城内情况呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_1311_1","isRemote":true,"text":"这几年变化不大。天灾不多，没怎么移动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_1311_1","isRemote":true,"text":"说实话，我们现在的状况很不乐观，如果军事委员会继续挤压我们的战略空间——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":true,"text":"相信殿下和凯尔希医生吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_1311_1","isRemote":true,"text":"......也是。她们为今天的实验准备了这么长时间，就是为了能扭转不利的局面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_050","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，Scout，你拿到我家里保存的设备了吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_1311_1","isRemote":true,"text":"已经交付信使运往巴别塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_050","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，有了凯尔希和我联手制造的秘密武器，一定可以彻底拿下船上那个奇怪的控制系统。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":true,"text":"我会接应信使，确认包裹安全后再送回本舰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":true,"text":"这段时间还在排查对失踪工程师下手的暗桩，本舰的威胁还没有完全清除。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥达","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希尔小姐，我按你说的拿了更多的材料过来，好沉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_050","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢啦，奥达！唔，看上去我还能再给殿下和凯尔希做一些保险措施。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_050","isRemote":false,"text":"再额外安装一条备用线路吧，这次千万不要再出意外了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥达","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有哪里需要我帮忙吗，可露希尔小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_050","isRemote":false,"text":"奥达，你也赶快和其他人一起撤离到安全区域去吧。下一波冲击......预计在三十分钟之后发生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_050","isRemote":false,"text":"现在一切就绪了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_050","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，有点好奇呢......凯尔希和殿下对能源模块和防御模块的秘密改造，还有那些奇奇怪怪的调研，到底是为了什么神秘的实验呀？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_abyss_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是对源石最了解的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果需要解决因源石而诞生的苦难......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是最合适的人选。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不得不说，你总是能带来一些连魔王都不敢轻易相信的事情......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些装置真的还能运作吗......你依然对他的苏醒抱有信心？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"泰拉的绝大多数生命形式都不可能抵抗如此漫长时间跨度的侵蚀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在的泰拉无疑是个奇迹。你也是，特蕾西娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但过去在他们的眼里，围绕着太阳运作的整个星系，都渺小无比。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你现在有点紧张喔。还有一些焦虑和不安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还有什么要担心的事情吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我......不能说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系！抱歉，我不该让你分心的，专注些。我感受得到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“凯尔希”......你爱着这个名字吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......几乎已经忘记了那段岁月的其他所有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我唯独记得，在那么远那么远的过去，有个人，将这个名字送给了我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“凯尔希”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是我们最后一次见面。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_i06_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"“凯尔希......我时间不多了。\n“去寻找生命的痕迹，去寻找希望与未来。\n“凯尔希......自己去得出答案吧。\n“去找到你自己。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那又何必再犹豫呢，凯尔希。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我始终有一个预感......担忧，或者说推测。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在大地的起点，生命方才开始萌芽的某个时间点，这里，发生了一些永远无法扭转的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我却不得而知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果是连凯尔希医生都能交付信任的人，我倒是完全不担心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"况且，按照凯尔希医生谨慎的个性，早就安排好的应对措施从来都不必让我操心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"很遗憾，特蕾西娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唯独在这件事上，无论做了多少应急预案，我都没有确凿的把握。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......特蕾西娅，我无法保证自己永远能做出最理性的选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而这次......我想去相信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那就做你想做的吧，我就在这里，陪着你。"},{"type":"narration","text":"凯尔希的手已经触摸到了这扇沉寂了不知多少岁月的门。\n罗德岛迎来了新一轮的震动。\n门，松动了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“源石会成为我们文明凝结而成的信标......\n“如有一天，寰宇中的其他生命形式重临死去的家园，求索破局之法，\n“他们会见证......\n“我们辉煌过，\n“我们抵抗过，\n“我们安眠于此。\n“我们也曾于湮灭之前递与后来者赠礼——\n“——希望。”"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_i06_1"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_i06_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）这里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）时间......已经......到了吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"警告：未知能源启动。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"警告：PRTS系统权限读写中......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"警告：PRTS系统权限读——\nPRTS系统权限已重置。管理员权限已确认。\n通信模块全频段开启，通信接收模块超频完成。\n检索：保存者......无信号。\n检索：深蓝之树......无信号。\n检索：天堂支点......无信号。\n检索：（未知杂音）......无信号。\n......\n检索已完成，全频段无信号。\n是否重试——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）没有......回应......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）只有......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）时间......过了多久？"},{"type":"narration","text":"检索进程日志文件中......\n最新更新：四百七十五万五千九百五十四天前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"检测到生命体征数据剧烈异常。自动加载修复模块。\n修复中——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）我......醒来太早......还是......太晚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）源石......处在哪个阶段？"},{"type":"narration","text":"检索源石检测历史数据......无响应。\n源石检测模块已离线。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）“泰拉”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）为什么储存......如此之多的......冗余信息......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）这......未记录在数据库......新的语言？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）文明......已经......诞生......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）只......剩......我自己......她呢，普瑞赛斯，我的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）我可以回答你的困惑。那些资料，是我先前储存在PRTS中的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）......你？"},{"type":"narration","text":"停留于过去之人的眼中闪过了一丝陌生，一丝疑惑，还有......一丝警惕。\n凯尔希敏锐地捕捉到了石棺中人的眼神。\n而特蕾西娅捕捉到了凯尔希的紧张。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）等等......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）虽然你变了许多......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"刚刚苏醒的人好似在石棺中做了一个短短的梦。\n入梦前与自己告别的生命，在梦醒时刻依旧守候在自己的身旁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）......你没有离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）不......自从离开这里，到如今我重新站在你的面前——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）我已经漫步了万余年光阴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）不过，我依旧未曾忘记你留给我的问题——"},{"type":"narration","text":"凯尔希等待着，忐忑着，她需要确定......\n确定她的希望未曾发生过什么可怕的变化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）那不是......问题，那是......我的期盼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）那你......已经寻找到自己生命的意义了吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“凯尔希......”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_abyss_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）寻找生命延续的意义——这依旧是我需要在未来继续踏上的道路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）你还记得......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）我记得......于我而言，与你的告别仿佛仍在昨日，又像是遥远到不切实际......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）但于你而言......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）我未曾有一刻忘记你为我做的努力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）除了生命之外，你赠与了我另一件最为宝贵的东西——自由，Dr.{@nickname}。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）还是......称呼我为博士吧，凯尔希。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）先让我......离开......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）你依旧很虚弱，我可以扶——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）不必了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）凯尔希，我有......太多的困惑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）源石如何了......我没有找到记录。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）源石依然在外面的大地上生长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）所以我醒得太早了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）你吃了很多苦，凯尔希。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）我从你的眼神里已经能够猜出来。你需要我的帮助？所以唤醒了我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）是我们需要你的帮助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）喔。那位“恶魔”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）在你身后的那位朋友身上，我不光看到了源石以意料之外的形式存在......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）她还拥有......嗯，“文明的存续”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）如今文明发展的轨迹很......复杂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（未知语言）名字，他们的文明中是否也存在类似指代其存在的称呼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特......蕾......西......娅......"},{"type":"narration","text":"醒来的人走到了特蕾西娅的面前，平伸出了自己的双手，露出掌心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_i21_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"特蕾西娅伸出了自己的手，她轻捧起了来自过去之人的双手。\n博士感受到了暖意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是的，特蕾西娅。"},{"type":"narration","text":"两个文明的触碰，特蕾西娅却从来自过去之人的眼中看到了忧伤。\n特蕾西娅从眼前之人的手中，感受不到温度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"源石......与......你......一体。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你了解我们的语言？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我从......记录......中......学习。不是......难事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不可思议！我还想学习你们的语言，凯尔希说——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的世界......已经失落。属于过往的语言......应该留在过往的时间中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......对你们感到好奇。你发现......甚至进入了“文明的存续”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我想......向你......请教——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"关于你们文明的，一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如此，我才能找到属于我......过去世界的蛛丝马迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔，“博士”，是这么说吧。请原谅我的冒犯，不要放开我的手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我会向你展示——"},{"type":"narration","text":"博士情不自禁地被这位形似恶魔的生灵的双眼所吸引。\n在恶魔的眼中，失去自己世界的人看到了——\n生命。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g10_iceonlake"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"文明自生物的本能中孕育，优胜劣汰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"强者捕食弱者，生存的循环由此而生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驮兽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（虚弱的哀鸣）"},{"type":"narration","text":"落入冰面之下的驮兽，用自己的头颅将一只幼崽从水中顶起，送上冰面。\n小驮兽在冰面上蹒跚着，走向了远处准备好诱饵等待着的猎人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_284_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它过来了，准备好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"猎人在冰面碎裂之前抓住了饥饿的小驮兽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_284_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幸好，我们至少救下了一个。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叛逆。违背生存本能的叛逆才是我们文明进化的契机。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而好奇心，以燃烧生命为代价的好奇心才是我们文明前行的阶梯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"追寻流星的拓荒者，背负着同伴的尸体继续向前挪行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的拓荒者","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......*哥伦比亚粗口*，为什么你就不能多坚持一天！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的拓荒者","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明报纸上都说了那是莱特夫妇失事的飞行器，不是流星，你还不死心一定要看个究竟！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的拓荒者","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过是从天空坠下的失败者，到底有什么值得你拿命去拼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的拓荒者","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些坠到大地上的石头吗？你到底想向我证明什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我也曾在黑王冠中见过太阳被吞噬，黑暗彻底笼罩整片大地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但即使是最为绝望的时刻，也依旧有人试图点亮光明。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的阿达克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"还是黑的！太阳真的死了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大胆的阿达克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，太阳死的时间也太长了......我们得抢救它！要是太阳活不过来，那我们尾巴的粗细岂不是争不出个结果？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的阿达克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么救？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大胆的阿达克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"爬到最高的山上，举着火把点燃它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的阿达克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"要是手举累了怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大胆的阿达克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......那就建一个我的雕像，让我的雕像替我举着火把。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的阿达克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"好主意！旁边还可以再建一个我的雕像举另一个火把，要是你的火把熄灭了，我的火把就能再点燃你的火把。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g5_furnaceplatform"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"燃烧带来光明，光明引导我们走向希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而我的同胞们，也将死亡视作希望的另一种诠释。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"当身体走向寂灭之后，在魂灵熔炉的火焰中与城市融为一体，是唯有值得尊敬之人才能享受的荣誉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他们会成为源石结晶生长出来，与卡兹戴尔融为一体。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"新生的幼童会在飘落的粉尘中成长，聆听着众魂的声音继续背负着苦难前行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"愚昧和进步混杂不清......循环往复，百转千折......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多么......美。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......多么令人，怀念。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们......泰拉似乎重新回到了正轨......步入启蒙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何以定义“愚昧”？又如何证明“启蒙”的进步？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我看来，这些都是我们文明的一部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你引导我看到的......他们大多与你们的种族......大相径庭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"征服者和被征服者，在文明的演变中都已经被这片大地烙印上无法磨灭的痕迹......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为了生存，我坚信最终所有的分歧都将被统一，所有的族群都将融为一体。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我所看向的未来，整片大地终将成为一个整体。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......振奋人心的信念......很了不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能感觉到，你......热爱这片大地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不论歧视、战争或是灾难......你所爱的都早已超脱了单一的个体或族群。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但当你......超越了你身处文明的极限时......没有人能理解你的爱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反而，他们......会憎恶你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你是否清楚，走到你所期盼的未来......要经历什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果这是必经之路，我会欣然接受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......特蕾西娅。一个泰拉人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难怪凯尔希信任你。她不惜冒险唤醒我，也想要帮助你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。总有这样的人，在每一个时代迎来终点的时刻，会试着力挽狂澜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但绝大多数时候，故事的结局并不美好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我敬佩你，绝无虚言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟某种程度上，你与我所熟识的一些人极为相似。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经无法与他们重聚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也许我还需要些时间整理思绪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但无妨。我想我应该......先听听你们的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们需要我做什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_abyss_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士。你需要休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希，她真的带给我很多的惊喜，也留给我更多的困难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉......是“困惑”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我对萨卡兹的语言，还没有完全熟悉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她让我看到很多意料之外的东西。你也......从她身上看到了许多吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我与她为敌，与她相识，理解她的愿望，敬畏她的责任......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那顶黑色的王冠与特蕾西娅分享了其所背负的悠久历史与见闻，她也逐渐拥有了非他人所能企及的远见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，也许这是最好的机会了，和她一起，和巴别塔一起，和泰拉一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“和泰拉一起”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你现在是属于“这片大地”的凯尔希了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也希望你能同我们前行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很羡慕你，也相信你，凯尔希。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我只是一个研究者，或许我能帮上的忙，并没有你们所期盼的那么多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"矿石病，天灾，我们束手无策的灾难给这片大地带来了诸多苦难......而泰拉的科技几乎完全建立在源石的基础上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能源的争夺、感染者歧视、战争和种族间的隔阂都在更进一步地撕扯这片土地......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们努力过，但是收效甚微......因为我们对源石一无所知。我们对这片大地一无所知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天空和海洋究竟发生了什么？古老的遗迹究竟从何而来？我们......又是如何诞生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们希望你能为我们找出一个答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......其中一部分，我想凯尔希已经与你分享过了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而关于源石，很可惜，现在的我无法给出答案。至少不是全部。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我苏醒时试图读取源石进展的日志，但很奇怪，一无所获。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你带领我对泰拉的一瞥让我产生了更多的困惑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今源石的发展......并不完全符合想象，我需要一些时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要自己去探索这片大地如今的样貌，了解源石对文化、生命以及环境具体造成了何等的影响。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这或许会花上几年，甚至更久......更何况，在耗费了庞大的精力后，你们也许会得到一个绝望的回答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾向人许下承诺，现在看来，也许留给我，或是留给她的只有......遗憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我不会轻言许诺，凯尔希。请原谅......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，我们等你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论你的回答是什么，巴别塔会坚持到你归来的那天，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......谢谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么......抱歉......我感到了一点......饥饿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我通过PRTS看到，本舰是有临时食堂的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"确实有，不过可能有点杂乱，不如我带你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不了，谢谢，特蕾西娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1360_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里对我来说，也有着特别的意义。就让我一个人......慢慢走过去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。请小心，博士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"苏醒的压力不小，他的身体还没有恢复到健全的状态。但他适应得很快。比我想的快得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他说想要学习关于泰拉的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他学习的速度同样很快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是孩子们和博士一样，也许他们有机会掌握更多的语言，去往大地的更多地方旅行呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西娅，你应该先回去找其他人，应该还有不少巴别塔的事务需要议长亲自表态才能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西娅？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......凯尔希，我在想一件事。可能是我多虑了，但我想告诉你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士似乎对泰拉变成今天的模样，深感意外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你曾说，他是对源石最了解的人。博士也说过，源石的发展......“并不完全符合想象”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那源石本该是什么模样？这片大地本该是什么模样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......萨卡兹本该是什么模样？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodescom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士已经准备好出发了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。他申请了一辆载具，一些防身武器，其他什么都没带。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他说自己能避开作战区。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了，按照博士的想法执行就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殿下，我想跟上他。他的来历很......我不放心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......阿斯卡纶，你离开过卡兹戴尔这片土地吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"离开？如果算上小时候追着猎物离开我们的活动范围，我离开过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可并不算数。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧，跟上博士。保护他，但不要打扰他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会监视好博士——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，阿斯卡纶，放轻松点。我并不是想让你监视他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想让你去看看家园之外的人如何生活，这是一个很好的机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生活？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我们的家园之外，战争和苦难从不是生活常态。美食，服饰，艺术和文化......我们可以拥有很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们中的许多人知道这一点，但更多的人选择忽视这个事实。因为我们大多时候并没有选择的余地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿斯卡纶，别露出这种表情，听我说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最初你因为反对特雷西斯的举措而跟随我，那，这次分裂结束之后呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你之后该做什么？无数与你有同样想法的萨卡兹们，下一站又在哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以离开战争、离开我们的家园去看看这片土地之外的景色，阿斯卡纶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去看看我们本应该拥有的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果这是您的期望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一路顺风。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
